    "updated_at": "2026-11-09T08:29:04Z",
    "body": "Brought this branch up to date after upstream #442 (Stock page theme button) conflicted with its parent #382 in `panes.rs` and `state.rs`.\n\n- Merged the parent's new tip (`origin/issue/287-machines-pane`, which now carries the #442 resolution: `Cmd::View` mentions the machines pane, `Cmd::Theme` added, `ribbon_theme_open` beside `PanelsOpen { …, machines: false }`). That merge was clean, and the follow-up merge of upstream/main had nothing left to do. Merge commit: `71504cee`.\n\nGate (`scripts/gate.sh quick upstream/main`, app + ui suites): all 6 pinning tests pass (`machine_assign` ×3, `egui_app::tests::machines_pane` ×3). The only reds are the known ones that also fail on main: the GPU headless tests (`headless_run_succeeds`, `headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`, `egui_headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`) and `setup_stock_source::a_new_block_after_a_flip…` (#415, fixed by #420).\n\nThe branch merges cleanly with main. It stays a draft until the GUI check.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
